version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/M0-AR/starlink-physical-atlas"
url: "https://m0-ar.github.io/starlink-physical-atlas/"
keywords:
  - Starlink
  - LEO
  - satellite constellation
  - SGP4
  - reproducibility
  - open data
  - space sustainability
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, claim-level verified physical atlas of the Starlink
  constellation using three public snapshots (2025-04, 2026-04, 2026-11),
  official SGP4 verification vectors, and published references. The artifact
  resolves shells, planes, migration, dynamics, service geometry, Doppler and
  radio-path latency, and reports every result through a generated metrics
  file, a 45-claim ledger, and a tested static site.
